{"3116440": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Ligmanauts", "steam_appid": 3116440, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A balls-to-the-wall co-op platformer for 2-8 players!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ligmanauts  has you rolling around and grabbing your friends by the fistful in co-op platforming mayhem for up to 8-players.      </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3116440/extras/77aa9a1fb8cc99d531783ffba42c755a.avif?t=1779762216\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3116440/extras_big/77aa9a1fb8cc99d531783ffba42c755a.avif?t=1779762216 width=1560 height=438 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore Dense Worlds</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scour the Ligma-verse for juicy fruits so that you and your friends can throw the most amazing punch party in the universe! Overcome challenges designed to test your crew’s co-opitism:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steer something that does not need eight people to steer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stack on top of friends until someone slowly leans the wrong way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a leap of faith trusting a player who shouldn’t be trusted.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3116440/extras/41bf7091845574174ab02aff1c51cbdf.avif?t=1779762216\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3116440/extras_big/41bf7091845574174ab02aff1c51cbdf.avif?t=1779762216 width=1560 height=438 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Classic Platforming Action</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Movement is fast, tactile, and playful. Roll, bounce, grab, swing, jump, and boost through physics-driven challenges that reward creativity and momentum over strict perfection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3116440/extras/5334fa5a161ce00a7f3f2ad1ce538963.avif?t=1779762216\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3116440/extras_big/5334fa5a161ce00a7f3f2ad1ce538963.avif?t=1779762216 width=1560 height=438 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Playground Hub</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between challenges, touch e-grass with friends in a shared hub – a persistent playground where you unlock toys, microgames, and cosmetics. Mess around together, play with your new toys and prep for the next level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3116440/extras/05ccd0b9c3f18c81d8f735f52a3eb1a0.poster.avif?t=1779762216\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3116440/extras/05ccd0b9c3f18c81d8f735f52a3eb1a0.webm?t=1779762216\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3116440/extras/05ccd0b9c3f18c81d8f735f52a3eb1a0.mp4?t=1779762216\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online multiplayer for up to 8 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local co-op split screen for up to 4 players (online or offline)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drop in, drop out: scales to whoever shows up</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple themed worlds with replayable scenarios</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics-driven movement built for expressive, cooperative play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shared progression and a persistent Playground Hub</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cosmetic unlocks and emotes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original Liquid DnB soundtrack</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A balls-to-the-wall co-op platformer for 2-8 players!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ligmanauts  has you rolling around and grabbing your friends by the fistful in co-op platforming mayhem for up to 8-players.      </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3116440/extras/77aa9a1fb8cc99d531783ffba42c755a.avif?t=1779762216\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3116440/extras_big/77aa9a1fb8cc99d531783ffba42c755a.avif?t=1779762216 width=1560 height=438 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore Dense Worlds</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scour the Ligma-verse for juicy fruits so that you and your friends can throw the most amazing punch party in the universe! Overcome challenges designed to test your crew’s co-opitism:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steer something that does not need eight people to steer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stack on top of friends until someone slowly leans the wrong way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a leap of faith trusting a player who shouldn’t be trusted.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3116440/extras/41bf7091845574174ab02aff1c51cbdf.avif?t=1779762216\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3116440/extras_big/41bf7091845574174ab02aff1c51cbdf.avif?t=1779762216 width=1560 height=438 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Classic Platforming Action</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Movement is fast, tactile, and playful. Roll, bounce, grab, swing, jump, and boost through physics-driven challenges that reward creativity and momentum over strict perfection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3116440/extras/5334fa5a161ce00a7f3f2ad1ce538963.avif?t=1779762216\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3116440/extras_big/5334fa5a161ce00a7f3f2ad1ce538963.avif?t=1779762216 width=1560 height=438 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Playground Hub</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between challenges, touch e-grass with friends in a shared hub – a persistent playground where you unlock toys, microgames, and cosmetics. Mess around together, play with your new toys and prep for the next level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3116440/extras/05ccd0b9c3f18c81d8f735f52a3eb1a0.poster.avif?t=1779762216\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3116440/extras/05ccd0b9c3f18c81d8f735f52a3eb1a0.webm?t=1779762216\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3116440/extras/05ccd0b9c3f18c81d8f735f52a3eb1a0.mp4?t=1779762216\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online multiplayer for up to 8 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local co-op split screen for up to 4 players (online or offline)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drop in, drop out: scales to whoever shows up</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple themed worlds with replayable scenarios</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics-driven movement built for expressive, cooperative play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shared progression and a persistent Playground Hub</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cosmetic unlocks and emotes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original Liquid DnB soundtrack</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Classic platforming action brought kicking and screaming into the voice chat era. Roll, bounce, grab, and swing through physics-driven challenges that only work when someone's yelling at someone else. Online or couch, drop in anytime.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3116440/04e19409497ea0846a761ba3c1c2e287a2b47382/header.jpg?t=1779762216", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3116440/928fd0533bc296f7825ec1d9f4c772f33cea4cba/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1779762216", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3116440/928fd0533bc296f7825ec1d9f4c772f33cea4cba/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1779762216", "website": "https://ligmanauts.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 SP1+, 8, 10, 64-bit versions<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel or AMD Processor, 2ghz+<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2048 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows